# AGENTS.md — Employee Movie Booking UI

Employee-facing movie ticket booking frontend. The running app is still the Vite + React starter. Feature folders under `src/` are empty.

UI should follow the TailAdmin dashboard in `../free-react-tailwind-admin-dashboard-main`. Copy and adapt pieces from there. Do not invent a second component style, and do not assume those files already exist in this repo.

Companion API (separate repo, also early): `../employee-movie-booking-api`.

